WEBVTT

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:04.520
Why does he always
make things so troublesome?

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:05.270
Yo.

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:11.190
Are you stupid or is it that
you just don't bother thinking?

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.900
We shouldn't involve ourselves with people.

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:17.030
Sorry, but that's not how I think.

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:21.000
Someone who doesn't understand
people wouldn't be able to save one.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:26.040
An ex-sprinter that can't
walk disappeared, huh?

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:28.960
It's worth leaving things
to me sometimes, right?

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:31.450
If you find the Horror, 
lead him to this slum.

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:33.670
I can't leave things to you.

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:35.190
Zaruba!

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:15.220
That hurt! What'd you do that for?!

00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:16.590
This is the best!

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:28.360
What a stupid movie!

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:29.440
Right?

00:01:53.750 --> 00:02:00.050
<i>The monochromatic empty eyes</i>
<i>of</i> <i>sapiens</i> <i>floating</i> <i>within the unreality</i>

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:05.430
<i>Completely peerless flowing</i> <i>blood,</i>
<i>controlled</i> <i>and digitized</i>

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:07.100
<i>Just dark world (BOOM)</i>

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:08.520
<i>Glitter world (NO DOUBT)</i>

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:09.690
<i>Can you see?</i>

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:11.860
<i>(BOOING BOOING) Hellacious</i>

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:13.230
<i>Just dark world (BOOM)</i>

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:14.900
<i>Glitter world (NO DOUBT)</i>

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:15.940
<i>I can see!</i>

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:17.950
<i>The timing of the programming</i>

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:18.820
<i>Yea, gotcha!</i>

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:22.530
<i>I want to be eroded away (brain wash)</i>

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:24.700
<i>Up the blast! </i>

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:28.750
<i>Ah, this dying world </i>

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:35.250
<i>Run like you're piercing through it</i>

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:41.590
<i>The rising flames burn everything away </i>

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:46.270
<i>Your resolve and your love</i>

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:49.850
<i>From darkness to the light</i>

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:32.310
Good morning!

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:35.520
Meifang. Sorry for making
you do this every day.

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:39.990
Is there reason for alarm each morning?

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:43.660
I keep thinking maybe
I'd wake up this time...

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:45.910
...right before I sleep.

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:56.380
<i>Nĭ zăo</i>, Sword.

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:58.170
<i>--Zăo</i>.
<i>--Zăo</i>.

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:00.840
Yeah! Yeah! Zao zao zao zao!

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:03.340
Hey, will someone take over
making breakfast sometimes?

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:06.600
No way. You don't pay rent!

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:09.680
On top of that you eat
the restaurant's food on a tab.

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:12.100
You need to make
the meals at the very least.

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:13.890
These are all Meifang's words.

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:16.690
You guys are all so cold.

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:23.610
Golden Knight's special fried rice.

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:26.620
It is a very rare item.

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:29.950
So boastful for a guy who
can't even wake up on his own.

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:32.010
My sleeps are deep.

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.670
I'm still not all wrinkly yet.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:38.500
Someone with the title of Garo,
judging another based on looks?

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:41.410
Then come out of retirement, Fei Long.

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:49.750
Hurry up and go check to see
if your master has some food for you.

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:54.600
Welcome!

00:04:58.360 --> 00:04:59.780
What a coincidence!

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:02.480
Why are you sitting there?

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:05.240
Why not? Let's chat.

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:10.740
Welcome!

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:11.970
Hello!

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:16.000
Oh. Hey, Sword!

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:18.130
I shouldn't interrupt your meal.

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:19.540
Sit down. I need to speak with you.

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:22.550
I don't know! I don't know!
I don't know her at all!

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:25.380
Hey, can I have some orange juice?

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:26.760
Oh, hello.

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:29.800
Young lady, maybe you
have the wrong person...

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:33.060
Oh, could this person
be a Makai Knight, too?!

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:40.890
That's her.

00:05:41.850 --> 00:05:43.630
The one from the highway incident.

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:54.290
Why is that little girl 
still involved with us?

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:56.330
There are these circumstances...

00:05:56.620 --> 00:06:01.040
You're putting someone who should
be protected into further danger.

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:04.420
I know.

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:07.720
Then, you must have no qualms
about me erasing her memory.

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:08.800
Calm down.

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:11.390
Our conversation is over.

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:16.200
That girl is also looking for El Dorado.

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:23.310
I don't understand you.

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:36.790
Thank you very much!

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:41.630
He seemed mad about something.

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:43.630
There are these circumstances...

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:45.170
Sounds tough.

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:48.590
So, did you find any clues on El Dorado?

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:51.280
No way things would be that easy.

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:54.560
You're the only one I can
depend on right now, Sword.

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:56.720
Um!

00:06:57.430 --> 00:07:00.690
Are you ready to order yet?

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:02.250
My respects.

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:04.150
A T-bone steak.

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:07.190
Got it!

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:10.530
Again?! Don't you think
about your nutritional balance?

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:14.410
If I eat thinking about something
like that, it won't be enjoyable.

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:17.080
It's my motto to enjoy everything I do.

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:21.330
What do you normally enjoy doing, Sword?

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:22.170
Watching movies?

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:25.250
I haven't gone to the movies in a while.

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:28.510
More importantly, where do you live, Sword?

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.170
Not telling.

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:32.840
Is it a total dump or something?

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:34.350
Well, Zaruba?

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:36.180
There's no need to tell you.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:03.750
Remember, you need strength
to get something done.

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:10.880
Without strength, you cannot
push through with your ideals.

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:16.290
Luke, you must be
stronger than anyone else!

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:22.060
Like I said!

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:25.650
There was a thread on the internet
about people disappearing!

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:26.900
At that movie theater!

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:28.320
No way.

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:31.780
I really wanted to dump the guy,
so we went there

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:34.660
to watch a movie I didn't wanna see!

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:39.230
I can't believe you did that!
Just tell him you wanna break up.

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:42.450
So, what happened?

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:45.460
Well, poof.

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:49.800
Hey. Hey. Hey...

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:51.260
Really?

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:52.210
Like a puff of smoke.

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:58.930
The money for the movie tickets!
From my wallet!

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:05.020
You're so stupid!

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:07.350
Eat shit, internet!

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:08.770
Eat shit!

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:14.780
Oh! Such a cute little customer. Just one?

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:21.290
Oh! I found you, Sword!

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:23.370
You can't run from me!

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:25.540
S-Sophie?

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:27.040
What? A criminal?

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:27.650
Huh?

00:09:27.650 --> 00:09:30.300
Sword. She's too young. She's an out.

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:32.960
I've misjudged you, as a person.

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:34.630
Hold on a second!

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:38.140
Why are you here?!

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:41.060
Look in your pocket.

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:42.510
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:46.270
That's mine.

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:48.270
I snuck it into your pocket at the diner.

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:52.400
Then I used a GPS item search
and went to the location!

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:54.900
What is with you?

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:56.950
You're more troublesome than expected.

00:09:57.910 --> 00:10:00.240
So, you use this to keep yourself in shape!

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:03.200
No wonder you can
beat up all those Horrors!

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:06.210
No, that's not how it works.

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:13.030
This is you, Sword, right?

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:16.130
Yeah.

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:19.130
Dear my brother...

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:21.460
So Sword is a big brother, too.

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:23.890
True.

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:26.610
You two don't live together, though, huh?

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:28.650
He's far away right now.

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:30.160
El Dorado?

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:31.560
No.

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:37.440
Oh, um...

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:40.500
Well, are you satisfied? I'll take you home.

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:47.000
I-I'm sorry I came on my own.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:52.210
No, well... Since you're here,
have some gyoza before you go.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:55.460
Can I take them home with me?

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:57.260
I want to share them during dinner!

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:19.020
Huh?

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:22.200
Father!

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:29.970
I've always...

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:34.670
I've always wanted to see you.

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:54.860
Thank you for waiting!

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:03.240
People are disappearing
at a movie theater.

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:04.410
Welcome!

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:07.010
Wasn't that a fake rumor on the internet?

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:08.780
Morning, Sword!

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:15.370
Sophie, I'm in the middle of something.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:17.260
Got it.

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:25.010
I'll take care of things by myself this time.

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:29.640
Looks like your hands
are full with babysitting.

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:30.990
H-Hey!

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:34.350
Says I'm busy with babysitting.

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:01.230
One adult ticket.

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:06.970
U-Um...

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:08.960
There is no smoking inside the building.

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:15.730
This is the third time I've been here.

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:16.860
Really?!

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:19.900
What's with this popcorn? A freebie?!

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:22.480
Really?! This movie theater is awesome!

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:28.120
It'd be bad if one of
the attendees was a Horror.

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:38.210
Excuse me, the showing is now over.
Did you forget something?

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:49.850
The schedules of the working staff
and the list of ticket sales...

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:52.780
Looks like I need to stake
the area out for a while.

00:13:57.560 --> 00:13:59.400
Sophie! Sesame oil!

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:00.290
<i>Hǎo de</i>!

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:02.690
Sophie! Dish prep!

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:03.400
<i>Hǎo de</i>!

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:04.570
Sophie!

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:05.820
<i>Hǎo de</i>! <i>Hǎo de</i>!

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:08.740
One of her like ten of Sword.

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:10.910
Really, jeez...

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:12.790
Sophie! Break!

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:14.650
<i>Hǎo de</i>! <i>Hǎo de</i>!

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:25.880
She doesn't know the meaning
of "Curiosity killed the cat."

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:27.760
She's a tough cookie.

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:32.810
It seems like Luke is having a
hard time on the movie theater case.

00:14:32.810 --> 00:14:34.680
Not that he's said anything about it to me.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:38.600
The better the Makai Alchemist,
the more stubborn they are.

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:40.730
He's just like you.

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:43.190
What part of me is stubborn?

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:45.280
The very tip of your toes
to the end of your beard.

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:49.780
Wasn't there talk about
that movie theater before?

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:51.780
The internet, huh?

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:56.790
Worth a shot if there's no success
with a direct approach like Luke's.

00:14:56.790 --> 00:15:00.040
Like they say, there are
no waves where there is no wind.

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:01.790
I'll help!

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:12.050
Isn't there a rumor going around
about couples going to a movie

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:14.510
in the city and one of them disappearing?

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:19.230
Oh, I know about it.
It came up in an urban legend thread.

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:21.440
It's just couples who 
love that sort of thing,

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:23.650
who are making a big deal about it.

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:26.820
Wasn't it that people who sit
on row L and didn't get separated

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:29.490
would always be happy together?

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:30.400
Row L?

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:32.850
Do you know how many
theaters with row L there are?

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:36.450
Does that have anything to do with the
rumor that seat number 13 is haunted?

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:39.830
Again, do you know
how many seat "13"s there are?

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:44.080
I heard the missing person cases during
the late showings are still unsolved.

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:47.090
Why don't you check out
the bizarre cases thread?

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:56.180
Rumors about a certain seat
keeps popping up here and there.

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:57.100
Seat?

00:15:57.470 --> 00:15:59.390
Even in other chatrooms,

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:02.440
there are good and
bad rumors about it everywhere.

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:05.110
A lot about row L and seat 13.

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:09.110
There might be something to it.

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:12.400
Row L and seat 13?

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:28.460
Luke.

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:36.050
Come, Luke! Don't slack off
just because this is training!

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:38.410
Yes!

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:54.030
Sword, I just got word
from the woman at the diner.

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:57.120
That's rare. Why?

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:58.830
Seems like Luke has disappeared.

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:11.050
Sword.

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:14.050
It's faint, but I can smell a Horror here.

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:17.500
Wait, Sword.

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:19.010
What is it?

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:20.350
This presence...

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:23.060
Looks like the enemy is
already right in front of us.

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:24.350
What?

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:26.700
Looks like the theater itself is a Horror!

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:48.200
Shit! You!

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:57.840
Do you think you can don the
armor with that level of strength?!

00:17:57.840 --> 00:18:00.910
Dear! You should take it
a little easier on him!

00:18:00.910 --> 00:18:03.600
At this rate, Luke's body
won't be able to keep up.

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:06.600
That's enough for today, Luke.

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:07.600
Mom...

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:09.270
You worked hard.

00:18:09.860 --> 00:18:14.400
I'll make you your favorite
lasagna when we get home.

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:16.930
Yeah.

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:24.040
No. I'm going to practice a bit longer.

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:32.540
It looks like a normal theater to me.

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:35.800
It's a powerful barrier,
but it's gotten unstable.

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:39.300
Otherwise, I wouldn't
have noticed so quickly.

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.350
The source of its instability...

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:42.720
Luke.

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:47.140
There must be a place for it
to eat, a crack in the barrier.

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:50.940
Rumors about a certain seat
keeps popping up here and there.

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:53.650
A lot about row L and seat 13.

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:55.400
There might be something to it.

00:19:05.490 --> 00:19:06.610
Come on!

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:13.180
This is...

00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:24.140
Luke! That's enough!

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:24.810
Huh?

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:28.380
But, I feel like I shouldn't give up yet...

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:31.210
What's important is
those feelings of yours.

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:35.520
As long as you have them,
you'll be able to face Dad tomorrow, too.

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:36.540
Am I right?

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:39.450
I understand.

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:43.180
Now, get your rest.

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:45.360
Relax

00:19:46.300 --> 00:19:48.230
and don't think about it all.

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:51.160
Mom.

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:54.630
Luke!

00:19:56.300 --> 00:20:00.300
What are you doing, you idiot?!
That's a trap!

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:03.550
Think about it. Your mother...

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:05.970
Huh? What about my mom?

00:20:06.310 --> 00:20:09.220
She died in front of your eyes!

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:36.940
Good job.

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:42.440
I'll definitely return this favor.

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:47.030
It's not like I did this
to make you owe me one.

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:51.300
It's just better for me to have you around.

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:53.110
I'll definitely return it!

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:54.960
Jeez.

00:21:55.370 --> 00:21:56.950
Oh, wait a second.

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:04.300
I was able to help you
because of Sophie's help.

00:22:05.220 --> 00:22:09.260
If you're gonna return the favor,
you should return it to her.

00:22:31.080 --> 00:22:41.130
<i>When I close my eyes I feel</i>
<i>gentle</i> <i>arms</i> <i>around</i> <i>me</i>

